1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,150
2036-yil. Toshkent.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,660
Ertalab soat yetti. Uchar taksi sizni Chilonzordan olib ketadi.

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:18,980
Choyxonada palovni robot damlaydi, lekin retsept hali ham buvijonniki.

4
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:24,130
Bozorda narx so'rash shart emas: ko'zoynak o'zi ko'rsatadi.

5
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,110
Maktabda har bir bolaning o'z AI ustozi bor.

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:33,610
Shifokor kasallikni u boshlanmasdan oldin topadi.

7
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:41,630
Fantastikami? Yo'q. Bularning hammasi bugun boshlanmoqda.

8
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:46,990
Siz 2036-yilga tayyormisiz?

